  "global_gates": [
    "Phase 2 requires an approved measurable business goal and owner before Phase 3.",
    "Phase 3 requires explicit approval of the product solution after alternatives and do-nothing are compared.",
    "Phase 6 module map requires user approval before Phase 7.",
    "Phase 6 must resolve implementation-critical reuse choices and the API verification contract; verified local reuse requires no package research.",
    "Phase 7 must resolve line-budget violations before Phase 8.",
    "Phase 10 is mandatory for code changes unless explicitly waived.",
    "Phase 15 cannot be skipped and validates the append-only harness execution trace.",
    "AI product work requires deterministic tests plus probabilistic evaluation, safety, fallback, cost, latency, monitoring, and rollback evidence.",
    "Phase 17 cannot be skipped when a pull request is in scope.",
    "Phase 19 production writes require explicit user authorization."
  ]
